a-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{Sf}_{\\in}}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{Sf}_{\\in}}\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (ordinal class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}\\)</span> (transitive-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[z,\\bar\\alpha]\">\\((\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[z,\\bar\\alpha]\\)</span> (metatheoretic satisfaction for the proper-class universe)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HODSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HODSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hod\\text{-}set} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{HODSet}_S(x) \\leftrightarrow \\forall y\\in\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathsf{Sf}_{\\in})\\;\\exists\\bar\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}^{n}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{Sf}_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land(\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[y,\\bar\\alpha]\\land\\forall z\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[z,\\bar\\alpha]\\to z=y\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hod\\text{-}set} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{HODSet}_S(x) \\leftrightarrow \\forall y\\in\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathsf{Sf}_{\\in})\\;\\exists\\bar\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}^{n}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{Sf}_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land(\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[y,\\bar\\alpha]\\land\\forall z\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[z,\\bar\\alpha]\\to z=y\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Satisfaction over the proper-class universe is deliberately marked metatheoretic; the set-coded satisfaction predicate is not applied to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V\">\\(\\mathsf V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]